# CVE IDs suppressed at the gate Task (ci/tasks/gate.yaml, --ignorefile),
# one per line, e.g.:
#   CVE-2024-9999
# A change to this file is a security-relevant review, not a formatting
# one: add an entry only after confirming this specific CVE does not
# affect the way cv_frontend actually uses the flagged package, and say
# why in the same commit.
